1
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:23,360
The lantern wick trembles in the wind

2
00:00:23,564 --> 00:00:26,604
The road is narrow and has no name

3
00:00:26,803 --> 00:00:29,860
The blade at my hip is still in its sheath

4
00:00:30,065 --> 00:00:33,132
A single footprint melts into the night

5
00:00:33,341 --> 00:00:36,356
I keep the name I will not call deep in my chest

6
00:00:36,559 --> 00:00:42,237
Holding the light low, I just keep walking

7
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:46,115
Don't let go, it isn't over yet

8
00:00:46,319 --> 00:00:49,349
Don't let go, scars become a map

9
00:00:49,555 --> 00:00:52,618
Roof tiles ring in the middle of the city

10
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,859
We rise again, we rise again

11
00:00:56,065 --> 00:00:59,091
Raise the light and walk on

12
