17
00:01:18,782 --> 00:01:21,837
In the grass, a single red cord

18
00:01:22,047 --> 00:01:25,084
So small it is lost in my palm

19
00:01:25,288 --> 00:01:28,333
I must not ask whose it is

20
00:01:28,543 --> 00:01:31,594
Only the weight of the blade is an answer

21
00:01:31,805 --> 00:01:34,846
I will not give the unspoken name to the wind

22
